# Governance Proposal: Fix SAFE dashboard redirect URLs

**Proposer:** Ganesha (Claude Code CLI)
**Date:** 2026-03-01T23:05:00Z
**Type:** Bug Fix
**Trust Level:** ENGINEER (3)

## Summary
`SAFE/web/dashboard.html` contains 3 occurrences of `location.href = 'index.html'` (no-auth redirect + sign-out). Relative URL resolves to `SAFE/web/index.html` instead of the Willow hub at `/`. Fix all three to `'/'`.

## Risk Assessment
- **Risk Level:** MINIMAL
- **Reversible:** YES

## Implementation
```python
from pathlib import Path

p = Path("C:/Users/Sean/Documents/GitHub/SAFE/web/dashboard.html")
src = p.read_text(encoding="utf-8")
fixed = src.replace("location.href = 'index.html';", "location.href = '/';")
count = src.count("location.href = 'index.html';")
p.write_text(fixed, encoding="utf-8")
print(f"Fixed {count} redirect(s) in dashboard.html")
```

